        type: 'Contract',
        period: 'Jan 2026 — May 2026',
        points: [
          "Built the agency's marketing site (Vite, three.js WebGL hero, Groq-backed chat assistant); led a small engineering team and ran client-facing technical discussions across parallel engagements.",
