          'Alongside client work, built Retro Lokal, a vintage storefront on Next.js 16, Supabase, and iyzico with a CraftJS page builder and a Flutter companion app.',
        ],
      },
    ],
  },
  {
    company: 'Pinsoft — IT Solutions and Consulting',
    location: 'Istanbul, Türkiye',
    roles: [
      {
        title: 'Research & Development Intern',
        type: 'Internship',
        period: 'Aug 2025 — Dec 2025',
        points: [
          'Built an image-based lost-baggage matching pipeline combining color, shape, and texture similarity with multi-angle, centroid-weighted voting — sole author across 161 commits and 29 versioned releases.',
