        type: 'Part-time',
        period: 'Jan 2026 — Mar 2026',
        points: ["Designed, built, and maintained the organization's website and internal digital tooling."],
      },
      {
        title: 'Independent — Game Developer',
        period: 'Aug 2024 — Dec 2024',
        points: ['Shipped an isometric RPG and a 2D office game in Unity and C#, handling gameplay design and art direction end to end.'],
